    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice, Slash, Dragon Blast, all hostiles and seal time altering zones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: Prevent Draith's (the bad guy's) army from altering time and monopolizing Earth's resources...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through a Cast of colorful characters with unique abilities. Take a stance against the NinjAnts, while dodging deadly robots. Evade guitar playing SkullE's and block staff attacks from &quot;MonkFU&quot; Monkeys! Defeat enemies in various locations  and collect power-ups to enhance your abilities! Search for Chibi-Dragon Eggs to obtain a loyal ride or die in battle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Roguelike/ Roguelite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Beat em up\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Power ups : Defense, Speed, Attack, Fire Damage, Ice Damage, etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Weapon Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Obtain a Dragon... some dragons have minions... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*More features and details will be revealed in future announcements!</p>",
